===England===
Manager: [[Gareth Southgate]]

[[England national football team|England]] announced a 33-man preliminary squad on 25 May 2021.<ref>{{cite news |last=Lucas |first=Jim |url=https://www.englandfootball.com/Articles/2021/May/25/20210525-england-provisional-squad-named |title=England provisional squad named for EURO 2020 |work=[[The Football Association]] |date=25 May 2021 |access-date=25 May 2021}}</ref> [[Mason Greenwood]] withdrew injured on 1 June,<ref>{{cite news |url=https://www.manutd.com/en/news/detail/man-utd-striker-mason-greenwood-withdraws-from-england-euro-2020-squad-with-injury |title=Mason withdraws from England Euro 2020 squad |work=[[Manchester United F.C.]] |date=1 June 2021 |access-date=1 June 2021}}</ref> with the final squad announced later that day.<ref>{{cite news |last=Lucas |first=Jim |url=https://www.englandfootball.com/Articles/2021/Jun/01/20210601-england-squad-named-for-uefa-euro-2020 |title=Final England squad named for UEFA EURO 2020 |work=[[The Football Association]] |date=1 June 2021 |access-date=1 June 2021}}</ref><ref>{{cite tweet |author=The Football Association |author-link=The Football Association |user=England |number=1399761179069845508 |date=1 June 2021 |title=Our EURO 2020 squad numbers have been confirmed! |access-date=1 June 2021}}</ref> [[Trent Alexander-Arnold]] withdrew injured on 3 June<ref>{{cite news |last=Walker |first=Andy |url=https://www.englandfootball.com/Articles/2021/Jun/03/20210603-trent-alexander-arnold-withdrawn-from-england-squad |title=Trent Alexander-Arnold withdrawn from squad |work=[[The Football Association]] |date=3 June 2021 |access-date=4 June 2021}}</ref> and was replaced by [[Ben White (footballer)|Ben White]] on 7 June.<ref>{{cite news |last=Walker |first=Andy |url=https://www.englandfootball.com/articles/2021/Jun/07/20210607-england-final-squad-member-confirmed |title=White completes EURO squad |work=[[The Football Association]] |date=7 June 2021 |access-date=7 June 2021}}</ref> After the team's first match, goalkeeper [[Dean Henderson]] withdrew injured and was replaced by [[Aaron Ramsdale]] on 15 June.<ref>{{cite news |last=Walker |first=Andy |url=https://www.englandfootball.com/articles/2021/Jun/15/20210615-aaron-ramsdale-called-into-EURO-squad-to-replace-dean-henderson |title=Ramsdale called into squad |work=[[The Football Association]] |date=15 June 2021 |access-date=15 June 2021}}</ref>

