===Hungary===
Manager: {{flagicon|ITA}} [[Marco Rossi (footballer, born 1964)|Marco Rossi]]

[[Hungary national football team|Hungary]] announced a 30-man preliminary squad on 6 May 2021.<ref>{{cite news |url=https://en.mlsz.hu/hir/prolific-hahn-joins-euro-qualifying-heroes-in-rossis-latest-squad |title=Prolific Hahn joins Euro qualifying heroes in Rossi's latest squad |work=[[Hungarian Football Federation]] |date=6 May 2021 |access-date=6 May 2021}}</ref> The squad was reduced to 29 players on 23 May as [[Szilveszter Hangya]] withdrew injured.<ref>{{cite tweet |author=Hungarian Football Federation |author-link=Hungarian Football Federation |user=MLSZhivatalos |number=1396405311481724933 |date=23 May 2021 |title=Hangya Szilveszter bokasérülés miatt nem lehet ott az Európa-bajnokságon. A MOL Fehérvár FC játékosa már elhagyta a válogatott keretét, helyére nem hív be más játékost Marco Rossi szövetségi kapitány. |trans-title=Szilveszter Hangya will not be at the European Championship due to an ankle injury. The MOL Fehérvár FC player has left the national team training camp, he will not replaced by the national coach Marco Rossi. |language=hu |access-date=24 May 2021}}</ref> [[Dominik Szoboszlai]] withdrew injured on 1 June, with the final squad announced later that day.<ref>{{cite news |url=https://en.mlsz.hu/hir/rossi-announces-26-man-squad-for-european-championship |title=Rossi announces 26-man squad for European Championship |work=[[Hungarian Football Federation]] |date=1 June 2021 |access-date=1 June 2021}}</ref> [[Dániel Gazdag]] left the squad on 16 June due to injury.<ref>{{cite tweet |author=Hungarian Football Federation |author-link=Hungarian Football Federation |user=MLSZhivatalos |number=1405107053635555332 |date=16 June 2021 |title=Gazdag Dániel sérülése sajnos a játékos és az egészségügyi stáb erőfeszítései ellenére sem jött rendbe, így a Philadelphia Union labdarúgója távozott a férfi A-válogatott keretéből és visszatér klubjához. Mihamarabbi gyógyulást kívánunk! |trans-title=Despite the efforts of the player and the medical staff, Dániel Gazdag has unfortunately not recovered from his injury and the Philadelphia Union footballer has left the national team and will return to his club. We wish him a speedy recovery! |language=hu |access-date=16 June 2021}}</ref>

