The above table is the same when it comes to league representation, with only the following exceptions:
* The [[English football league system|English league system]] had 153 representatives, including six players from Wales-based [[Cardiff City F.C.|Cardiff City]] and [[Swansea City A.F.C.|Swansea City]].
* The [[United States soccer league system|American league system]] had 7 representatives, including one player from Canada-based [[CF Montréal]].

No national team had all its players from the nation's club teams. Every national team also had at least one player from a club of its nation, though Wales had no players from [[Welsh football league system|its league system]].

